  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag2.9" class="h1">Thag 2:9  Gotama</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>At ease sleep the sages</p>
              <p class="v2">who</p>
              <p>are not bound to women,</p>
              <p class="v2">in whom</p>
              <p>always to be protected</p>
              <p>is the truth</p>
              <p>very hard to gain.</p>
              <p class="v2">Sensuality,</p>
              <p>we’ve carried out</p>
              <p>your execution.</p>
              <p>No longer are we in your debt.</p>
              <p>We go now to unbinding</p>
              <p class="v2">where,</p>
              <p>having gone,</p>
              <p>one doesn’t</p>
              <p>grieve.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
            <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../Thig/thig1_11.html">Thig 1:11</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
